# Pangenome: what block-independent ACEAPEX loses on repeats between assemblies, and a reference-segment prototype
# ace-core (EPYC 4344P 8c/16t, 16 threads), 2026-10-02. Format unchanged; AX_REFSEG is a prototype with its own container.

